# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# permissions/autogenerated/ - one allow-<cmd>/deny-<cmd> permission pair
# per command build.rs's commands_from_generate_handler() parses out of
# src/lib.rs's own `generate_handler!` block, regenerated deterministically
# by tauri-build's AppManifest::commands() on every `cargo build`/`cargo
# tauri dev`. Same category as /gen/schemas above: build output, not
# hand-edited, never committed. capabilities/*.json (which IS committed)
# is what actually grants these per window.
/permissions/autogenerated
